<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL LINE-UP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL LINE-UP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Cup quarter-final line-up after Wednesday's final Champions' League fixtures (first leg March 5, second leg March 19):</p>
<p>1 Borussia Dortmund (Germany) v Auxerre (France)</p>
<p>2 Manchester United (England) v Porto (Portugal)</p>
<p>3 Ajax Amsterdam (Netherlands) v Atletico Madrid (Spain)</p>
<p>4 Rosenborg Trondheim (Norway) v Juventus (Italy)</p>
<p>Semifinals over two legs on April 9 and 23 between winners tie 1 v tie 2 and tie 3 v tie 4.</p>
<p>Final to be played on May 28.</p>
</text>
